![](sp.jpeg){width=120px}

My name is Sergio Palomeque; I have a PhD in Economics from the University of Buenos Aires [(FCE-UBA)](http://www.economicas.uba.ar/doctorado/){target="_blank"}, I am Assistant Professor at the Department of Management Sciences of the School of Economics and Management - University of the Republic [(FCEA-UdelaR)](https://fcea. udelar.edu.uy/){target="_blank"} and co-coordinator of the [Regional Studies Association Research Network on Knowledge, Innovation and Regional Development in South America (KIRDSA)](https://www.regionalstudies.org/network/knowledge-innovation-and-regional-development-in-south-america/){target="_blank"}.

On this site, you can access information about my research areas, publications, teaching materials and courses.

The means to get in touch with me and find out more about my work are:

sergio.palomeque@fcea.edu.uy

